sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst as Security Analyst
    participant UI as React Dashboard
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Mongo as MongoDB
    participant Redis as Redis / Celery
    participant Static as Static Analyzer
    participant Dynamic as Dynamic Normalizer
    participant ML as Multimodal Ensemble
    participant XAI as SHAP / Captum XAI

    Analyst->>UI: Upload PE Binary
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/scans (PE Bytes)
    API->>API: Validate PE Header & Size Bounds
    API->>API: Compute SHA-256 Checksum
    API->>Mongo: Insert Scan Record (Status: QUEUED)
    API->>Redis: Enqueue Celery Task
    API-->>UI: Return Scan ID & Metadata

    Redis->>Static: Trigger Async Analysis
    Static->>Static: Parse Headers, Sections, Imports, Entropy
    Static-->>ML: Extract 17 Static Features (static-v1)

    Redis->>Dynamic: Process Telemetry Sequence
    Dynamic->>Dynamic: Normalize & Encode Events (seq_len <= 256)
    Dynamic-->>ML: Extract 14 Dynamic Features & Index Sequence

    ML->>ML: Evaluate Static RF (P_static) & Dynamic LSTM (P_dynamic)
    ML->>ML: Compute Ensemble P = 0.5*P_static + 0.5*P_dynamic
    ML->>XAI: Compute SHAP & Captum Attributions
    XAI-->>Mongo: Store Analysis Report & XAI Metadata (Status: COMPLETED)

    Analyst->>UI: View Scan Dashboard
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/reports/{scan_id}
    API->>Mongo: Retrieve Authoritative Report
    API-->>UI: Render Probabilities, Risk Band & XAI Visuals
